.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt POWERD 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm powerd
.Nd the power management daemon
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the server of IOKit's power management functions, started by
.Xr launchd 8
(org.minkar.powerd) for the
.Li com.apple.PowerManagement.control
service.
.Bl -bullet
.It
Assertions: processes create, change, retain and release them
.Pq Fn IOPMAssertionCreateWithName ... ;
they are listed by process, by type and as a status, and go when their
process exits or their timeout expires.
Their combined levels go to the kernel's root domain, which keeps the
display awake or the system from idle sleep accordingly; declared user
activity wakes the display.
.It
Settings: the active power settings go to the kernel as the display,
disk and system idle timers, and as the root domain's settings, when
.Nm
starts and whenever they change.
.It
Scheduled and repeating power events are kept in
.Pa /Library/Preferences/SystemConfiguration/com.apple.AutoWake.plist ;
power sources other processes publish are listed with the others.
.It
A platform that cannot sleep says so in the root domain's
.Li IOSleepSupported ;
.Nm
then disables system sleep, so that it is never attempted.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /System/Library/LaunchDaemons/org.minkar.powerd.plist
.It Pa /Library/Preferences/SystemConfiguration/com.apple.AutoWake.plist
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr caffeinate 8 ,
.Xr pmset 1
